      "content": "That makes sense. I just want to be 100% sure about the boundary. Is there a specific way I should document my work process to prove that I'm just using my \"memory\" and not stealing their IP? Like, if they ever audited me, what's the difference between a \"residual\" and \"proprietary information\" in a practical sense? If the logic is very specific to their exact data structure, does that move it out of the \"residual\" category?",
